  "description": "THIS MOD MOVED TO STEAM!!! <https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3503458514>.\n\nHighly recommend deleting this version and getting the steam version, as the steam version now includes unique unit cards and 2D portholes for all 7 variants. No more stretched face 2D porthole!\n\nVariant Selector All-In-One version of the Loi reskin.\n\nThanks to habu_s, download now includes @@All_Loi_Variant_selector.pack for use with variant selector. You do not need any individual reskin file if using the all-in-one. I will be keeping the individual downloads because the all-in-one is quite a large file in comparison. @@All_Loi_Variant_selector.pack Requires Variant Selector and I recommend using \"Rotate All Lords and Heroes\" as well. both are linked below.\n\n8 separate pack files that each reskin Ensign Loi of the Corrupted Compendium. Choose which version you like (A, B, C, D, E, F, DD) based on the screenshots, then download the associated pack file and add it to your data folder.\n\nYou need PassingByPosts's Corrupted Compendium (and the mods it requires). This mod must be loaded above the compendium in the load order, see screenshot.\n\nCan be added or removed or swapped mid campaign/save.\n\nVersions A, B, C use assets from HuaJS258's mod \"Slaanesh Corrupted Cathay Roster\",\n\nVersions D, E, F, DD use assets from Ashkaari's mod \"Blushing Moon Unit Replacer\"\n\nneither mod is required and they will not conflict, although mod manager tools will show a conflict. My variants just contains a few of the exact same asset files so that the original mods are not requirements.\n\nVariant Selector:\n\n<https://steamcommunity.com/workshop/filedetails/?id=2888171970>\n\nRotate All Lords and Heroes\n\n<https://steamcommunity.com/workshop/filedetails/?id=2793127003>",
